| PUT | `/barang/{id}` | Update barang |
| DELETE | `/barang/{id}` | Hapus barang |
| GET | `/barang/kategori` | List semua kategori |

### Utility Endpoints (Public)
| Method | Endpoint | Deskripsi |
|--------|----------|-----------|
| GET | `/health` | Status API + DB |
